  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np23:1.3.19": "Sp 1.621: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Olīnavilīnānīti heṭṭhā ca ubhatopassesu ca gaḷitāni</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Olīnavilīnāni</i>: dripping from below and from both sides.” ",
